    "title": "Norman Love marks 25 years of chocolate innovation - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Evan Williams ,\n10 hours ago Norman Love is a household name among chocolate connoisseurs, iconic for his pioneering use of color, turning treats that traditionally came in shades of brown into vibrant jewels of delectable modern art. Painted in hues like Key lime green or sunset pink flecked with sky blue, the chocolates also reflect Love’s South Florida roots. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
